{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10303","headline":"送徐大夫赴南海 · 皇甫曾","name":"送徐大夫赴南海","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旧国当分阃，天涯荅圣私。\n大军传羽檄，老将拜旌旗。\n位重登坛後，恩深弄印时。\n何年谏猎赋，今日饮泉诗。\n海内求民瘼，城隅见岛夷。\n由来黄霸去，自有上台期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫曾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10303.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10303","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}